17
00:00:58,298 --> 00:01:03,121
Every news story is written by someone,
and every writer makes some choices.

18
00:01:03,368 --> 00:01:06,917
Some of those choices,
are, you know, are tiny.

19
00:01:07,138 --> 00:01:13,487
A single word, call the same crowd
protesters or rioters, and already

20
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:17,990
told the reader how to feel before
they have read the second sentence.

21
