64
00:04:09,057 --> 00:04:12,114
First, we set up the X, formerly Twitter.

65
00:04:12,438 --> 00:04:15,932
we use the API to pull trending
topics and the latest news.

66
00:04:15,988 --> 00:04:16,809
X is fast.

67
00:04:16,838 --> 00:04:19,373
It's often where story breaks first.

68
00:04:19,793 --> 00:04:24,599
And the trends tell you what people are
