69
00:04:24,652 --> 00:04:30,435
So X gave us the what, what should we,
what should we be looking at today?

70
00:04:30,772 --> 00:04:35,343
but a tweet is short, and bias in
journalism lies in full articles,

71
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:39,640
the, in the head- in the headline, the
