77
00:04:58,296 --> 00:05:03,035
It gives you many, from the outlets
across the spectrum, and the bias

78
00:05:03,061 --> 00:05:05,652
is much easier to see side by side.

79
00:05:06,048 --> 00:05:11,431
And when five outlets cover the same
event and one says clashes while the

80
00:05:11,431 --> 00:05:16,038
other say attack, that difference is
